
INTRO(3M)           UNIX Programmer's Manual            INTRO(3M)

NAME
     intro - introduction to mathematical library functions

DESCRIPTION
     These functions constitute the math library, _l_i_b_m. They are
     automatically loaded as needed by the Fortran compiler
     _f_7_7(1).  The link editor searches this library under the -lm
     option.  Declarations for these functions may be obtained
     from the include file <_m_a_t_h._h>.

